{"step_index":86,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:58:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:58:27-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Just Like Paradise\" \"Paradise Lost\" \"Tits, Ass, Drug Money\" \"Vice City, Baby\" \"Top of the World, Ma!\"\" returned the following summary:\nThese are the titles of the five story chapters in ***Grand Theft Auto VI***, outlining the campaign progression for Jason and Lucia[1]:\n\n1. **Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise** – Set primarily in the Leonida Keys[2][3].\n2. **Chapter 2: Paradise Lost** – Set around Port Gellhorn[2][4].\n3. **Chapter 3: Tits, Ass, Drug Money** – The characters' arrival and establishment in Vice City[2][5].\n4. **Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby** – Deepening criminal operations within Vice City[2][5].\n5. **Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma!** – The game's final story chapter and finale[1][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [redbull.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHeOE9WIBRJWFAOumsFdKv7hpowHFlsgnd-qpBJq6GuH233DFT4VkgWe2USX7i5WvG-MCzBxaDvJhbbnRDv1qzN7MrNjlXsJlotRzIYKrbf_tnfmfobC5Hnni0YS5ktqzngi84Vu4DmRLK5TAiiJiE=)\n[2] [gamesradar.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-xu9cIQT0dg29eQNhcFX4MqHcaMGDZ2SzkN1dgGmK98od1GIlSRya6uRCLKSYtL23j4GqBVIlrAQ8ng_3RRnpMA0BWSMPwMT2QOVcMl0wVS8b3pvRmFTGY-R8dYPETSrRaLLFUi2wXIYznwkwVvImPiJgkIyCllDiKlA=)\n[3] [space4games.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6TOCiM0iFH_ON2_C-1PKkpK_FWpzPfOb6W8InbFJQeq1fIua9XbR7J-kl95wzwq6-wfvpbTpL4I17w61Y731Z1C5b8OXMn7GgokpfTjcylXAesglcOhnjYMpdN1zIMHi628LhFiAfhijiooX96ONBc_l6qJQlAFa4Ds0_jTooU53ROKQf)\n[4] [pcgamer.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIalYqkSY9WchlvJ_2JjfhZ84n-pEN-dYnCG866gACKSDqsIWzITK5f9DJ5TJsxcrqPJoMMPqr_AVpyTrQEX-BWZkUQrdtTe9YfCD3480TmTlX9qH94vlm9Z8u8RY7yBv9E1U1K2gvpR2ogk5iRj8lASNntEw3eEQ=)\n[5] [ldshop.gg](https://vertex