{"step_index":92,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:58:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T17:58:44-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T17:58:48-05:00\nThe search for \"\"Chapter 3: Tits, Ass, Drug Money\" \"Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby\" \"Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma!\" missions list\" returned the following summary:\nHere are the mission breakdowns for **Chapters 3, 4, and 5** of **Grand Theft Auto VI**, covering Jason and Lucia's escalation into the criminal underworld of Vice City and the game's finale[1][2].\n\n---\n\n### **Chapter 3: Tits, Ass, Drug Money** (26 Missions)\n*This is the longest chapter in the game, marking the official arrival in Vice City, building deeper criminal ties with figures like Boobie Ike and Raul Bautista, and setting up major heists[3][1][4][5].*\n\n1. Welcome to Vice City[6]\n2. Dealer's Choice[6]\n3. Meet the Heders[6]\n4. Dubious Provenance[6]\n5. Mami Knows Best[6]\n6. South Leonida Real Estate[6]\n7. Tyrone[6]\n8. Here, Kitty Kitty[6]\n9. *Ride or Die*[7]\n10. *Caught Slipping*[7]\n11. *Join Billy On a Job*[7]\n12. *Peach*[7]\n13. *Sinfrontera National Bank*[7]\n14. *Security Expert*[7]\n15. *Company Property*[7]\n16. *Heist Planning*[7]\n17. *Cooties*[7]\n18. *Safe Word*[7]\n19. *Read The Label*[7]\n20. *Check On Kyle*[7]\n21. *The Missing Link*[7]\n22. *Puff Puff Pass*[7]\n23. *Hidden Charges*[7]\n24. *Bricked Up*[7]\n25. *The Cartel Heist*[7]\n26. *Ocean Beach* / Chapter transition[7][8]\n\n---\n\n### **Chapter 4: Vice City, Baby** (25 Main Missions)\n*Stakes and tension peak as Jason and Lucia settle into Ocean Beach, handle celebrity security, run intelligence, and prepare for high-level airport and cartel operations[9][10].*\n\n1. Ocean Beach[8]\n2. Another Life[8]\n3. Company Cars[8]\n4. Lawyer Up[8]\n5. Party Hard[8]\n6. Heavy Lifting[8]\n7. Making Gainz[8]\n8. Too Much Baggage[8]\n9. Watch It[8]\n10. Cash Injections[8]\n11. Amateur Hour[8]\n12. Dirty Work[8]\n13. Adventures in